{
  "name": "06-signed-out-hold-verify",
  "description": "A login is found signed out during a run while the only other candidate is signed out too, so the task is held with credential_signed_out and a Needs you item asks the owner to sign in again; the owner signs in again on the other login, the helper's verify passes, the hold closes and the run continues on that login with credential.switched.",
  "covers": [
    "PRD Quality requirements, test 10: a sign-out found during a run holds the task with a Needs you item.",
    "PRD Handoff, When no candidate is available: credential_signed_out when at least one candidate is signed out; the lease clock pauses, the step is wait_owner, the item is Account signed out.",
    "PRD Handoff, Waiting on a sign-in: the hold closes when credential.verified is written for a candidate, and the task resumes on it with credential.switched (plan SM-7).",
    "PRD Owner interface: Sign in again writes no event; the helper's report of the sign-in check writes credential.verified.",
    "Plan IF-37 (P-9): the helper's report events carry its key."
  ],
